---
import Legal from "../components/Legal.astro";
import { site } from "../config";
---

<Legal
  kicker="Privacy"
  title="Privacy, EyesRhythm"
  description="We care about your privacy. EyesRhythm stays on your computer."
  heading="We care about your privacy."
  lede="That is the reason this app stays on your computer."
>
  <p>
    EyesRhythm is meant to sit next to you, not on someone else’s server.
    Everything stays on your computer.
  </p>
  <p>
    Your camera never leaves this machine. Frames are looked at in the moment,
    then gone. We do not record your face, we do not upload video, and we do
    not keep a film of you.
  </p>
  <p>
    Blink counts, screen time, and the little settings you choose live in a
    folder on your computer. That folder is typically{" "}
    <code>.eyerhythm_blinkcounter</code> in your home directory. It is yours.
    We never see it.
  </p>
  <p>
    There is no account and no license key. No cloud. No analytics. Ordinary
    days at the desk do not need the internet.
  </p>
  <p>
    This website is a quiet page. It does not set cookies and it does not watch
    you. The download buttons send you the Mac or Windows installer. We never
    see a card, because there is nothing to pay.
  </p>
  <p>
    EyesRhythm is a small wellness companion, not a medical device. If your
    eyes keep hurting or your vision changes, please see an eye doctor.
  </p>
  <p>
    Questions are welcome at{" "}
    <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
